  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：我们下一时代的前沿智能",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e446ddf40926d6ec",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon 在复杂工作流中提供前沿性能，适用于真实世界的软件工程、法律和金融等企业知识工作，以及网络安全防御。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2299b4ad6ef4761",
      "translationZh": "谷歌DeepMind副总裁兼首席AI架构师",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持 audio 元素。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式人工智能仍处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3496404cbe58bf3",
      "translationZh": "Google 的全新 Gemini 4 Argon 模型为复杂的、长期的专业任务带来了高级推理能力。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ec24f5d355a4c19",
      "translationZh": "该模型具备业界领先的 100 万 token 限制，可用于深度、多步骤的问题求解。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a356e4fe93185ae",
      "translationZh": "它在编码、金融研究、法律起草以及自主的网络安全漏洞修补方面表现出色。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4af5bce3a113e10",
      "translationZh": "Argon 正在通过 Fairwind 计划向受信任的网络防御者进行推广。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f1c58e48b567824",
      "translationZh": "Google 正在将安全性和严格测试放在首位，随后才会向公众更广泛地发布。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式人工智能仍处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c08adb852efb865f",
      "translationZh": "在此层级安全地发布前沿能力需要分阶段的方法。我们正积极参与美国政府的自愿预发布模型访问流程，同时逐步扩大访问范围。我们将继续收集早期测试者的反馈，在迭代安全防护措施后，尽快向开发者、企业和消费者提供 Argon。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "404008aeeb85335a",
      "translationZh": "Argon 将以每百万输入代币 1 美元、每百万输出代币 10 美元的入门价推出，缓存的输入代币价格为输入代币价格的 95% 折扣。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6d133c30c833489d",
      "translationZh": "改变我们在 Google 的工作和构建方式",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b9c344665eb2fa5",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon 已经在我们的内部工作流中提供动力，数千名谷歌员工在专门的编码任务、深入研究以及高质量写作方面凸显了该模型的优势。它帮助团队更快构建，推动工程生产力的边界，并加速突破。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "23408df7c271f641",
      "translationZh": "内存效率：一支 Argon 代理团队分析了全 fleet 的分析遥测数据，自动识别并在 Google 数据中心实施内存优化，部署后释放了超过 300 TiB 的内存，总计预计可节省 500 TiB 到 1 PiB 的内存。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "40d327d1cf4fbf53",
      "translationZh": "更努力地解决您最复杂的问题",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d88c17fda24211e7",
      "translationZh": "为了支持 Gemini 4 Argon 在更长、更复杂的使用场景中的能力，我们将模型的输出 token 限制大幅提升至行业领先的 100 万 token，远高于之前的 64K token。当模型拥有足够的空间进行深度思考并在单次生成路径中产生数十万 token 时，它能够在一次性求解困难问题时提供全新的推理深度。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    }
  ],
